<section id="features" class="bg-white" aria-label="What it does today">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-4">What you can do today</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-body leading-relaxed max-w-xl mb-16">Daily school operations, in one place.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8 mb-16">
      <article class="border border-line rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white hover:border-ink/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-line bg-surface flex items-center justify-center mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">01</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Set up your school once</h3>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">Create your academic year, terms, grades and streams in minutes.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="border border-line rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white hover:border-ink/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-line bg-surface flex items-center justify-center mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">02</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Build your timetable</h3>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">Create templates, assign classes to slots, and see the week at a glance.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="border border-line rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white hover:border-ink/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-line bg-surface flex items-center justify-center mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">03</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Handle teacher absences</h3>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">Record substitutions so every class stays covered.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="border border-line rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white hover:border-ink/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-line bg-surface flex items-center justify-center mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">04</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Take attendance</h3>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">Mark daily attendance by class from any device.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="border border-line rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white hover:border-ink/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-line bg-surface flex items-center justify-center mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">05</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Keep the school calendar</h3>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">Events and rooms in one place.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="border border-line rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white hover:border-ink/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-line bg-surface flex items-center justify-center mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">06</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Browse the curriculum</h3>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">Subjects, topics and sub-topics organised for your teachers.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <figure class="border-2 border-dashed border-line bg-surface rounded-2xl aspect-[4/3] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 p-6 text-center">
